STYLING [Tailwind CSS and component styling conventions]
deps=index.cuntext

approach:
  Tailwind utility classes only — no CSS modules, no styled-components
  Component variants: cva() from class-variance-authority (see components/ui/)
  Dark mode: class strategy — toggle "dark" on <html>, read via dark: prefix
  Responsive: mobile-first — sm: md: lg: xl: 2xl: breakpoints

conventions:
  Layout spacing: p-4 p-6 p-8 (4=1rem, 6=1.5rem, 8=2rem)
  Container: max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8
  Typography: prose class from @tailwindcss/typography for markdown content
  Colors: use CSS variables (--background --foreground --primary etc) not raw colors
  note: CSS variables defined in app/globals.css — add new tokens there, not inline

shadcn-ui:
  Add component: npx shadcn@latest add {component-name}
  All primitives in components/ui/ — extend by wrapping, not modifying
  Docs: ui.shadcn.com

animations:
  tailwindcss-animate (bundled with shadcn) for enter/exit
  Complex: framer-motion — import { motion } from "framer-motion"

ex:
  # responsive card with dark mode
  <div className="rounded-lg border bg-card p-6 shadow-sm dark:bg-card/50">
    <h2 className="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Title</h2>
    <p className="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Body text</p>
  </div>
